flowchart TD
  listener[Application listener and verified identity] --> server[MCP server export]
  public[Explicit public operation] --> server
  server -->|validated arguments and request identity| handler[Application handler and authorization]
  handler -->|domain result| projections[Validated model and view projections]
  probe[Both web-host recipient probes] -.->|required before freezing mapping| projections
  projections --> model[Model-visible safe result]
  projections -->|supported recipient mapping| bridge[MCP view export]
  bridge --> renderer[Application renderer and catalog]
  server --> resource[Immutable resource and CSP]
  resource --> bridge
  handler -->|denied or failed| failure[Safe failure and retired work]
  projections -->|invalid or unsupported| failure
  failure --> renderer
